 ("`_CUR_FONT`, `_cmap_cache`, `_font_cache`, `_WARNED`, `_T2_WARNED`, `_T2_CARD_PARTS`, `_PRESET`", "mutable dict/set caches", "safe if never rebound; selftest clears some of them", "move with their only users; selftest must reference the module object"),
